msgid "Telegram Desktop Accessibility"
msgstr "Telegram 電腦版無障礙支援"

msgid ""
"Improves Telegram Desktop accessibility for NVDA users.\n"
"\n"
"Adds Alt+1 to move focus to the chat list, Alt+M to open Telegram's main menu, and Alt+Y, Alt+N, Alt+A and Alt+V to answer a call, hang up, mute the microphone and turn the camera on or off. The add-on uses Telegram's stable UIA class information and leaves Telegram's native accessible names unchanged."
msgstr ""
"改善 Telegram 電腦版與 NVDA 搭配使用時的無障礙體驗。\n"
"\n"
"新增 Alt+1 將焦點移至聊天室清單、Alt+M 開啟 Telegram 主選單，以及 Alt+Y、Alt+N、Alt+A 與 Alt+V 用來接聽通話、掛斷、開關麥克風與開關攝影機。附加元件使用 Telegram 穩定的 UIA 類別資訊，並保留 Telegram 原有的無障礙名稱。"

msgid "Added call commands that match UnigramPlus: Alt+Y answers an incoming call, Alt+N declines it or ends the call in progress, Alt+A mutes or unmutes the microphone, and Alt+V turns the camera on or off. Each command reports the action in Telegram's own wording. Updated all translations and manuals for version 0.1.4."
msgstr "新增與 UnigramPlus 相同的通話指令：Alt+Y 接聽來電、Alt+N 拒接來電或掛斷進行中的通話、Alt+A 開啟或關閉麥克風、Alt+V 開啟或關閉攝影機。每個指令都會以 Telegram 本身的用語報出所執行的動作。所有翻譯與說明文件已更新至 0.1.4 版。"

